  abilityDesc: 9 combo massive Light attack on single foe (damage relative to remaining
    HP), considerably raises normal hit amount for 3 turns, greatly boosts Def relative
    to Atk for 3 turns, greatly boosts Atk relative to Def for 3 turns, slightly
    boosts OD gauge & greatly boosts own Atk for 3 turns
